{"kind": "mod", "id": 981, "name": "Balanced Overhaul Of Bullet Spawns (BOOBS)", "slug": "balanced-overhaul-of-bullet-spawns-boobs", "teaser": "All ammo types spawn as loose loot, balanced by caliber and tier!", "owner_name": "Jehree", "downloads": 18589, "favourites": 22, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.jehree.boobs", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Overhauls", "category_id": 2, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:48:19.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-07-18T14:38:58.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-07-18T14:38:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.11", "latest_version": "3.2.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>WHAT IT DO:</strong></p>\n<p>Adds cardboard ammo boxes for all rounds in the game, and then rebalances the loose loot for each map to give a good variety of all ammos, balanced by caliber and also by tier. (it will also spawn UGL rounds, grenades, and flares rarely).</p>\n<p>**Config stuff:</p>\n<p>I have already set up a decent set of weight multipliers, but if you want to mess with them yourself, you can do so in BOOBS/config.json. Know that the weighting of each caliber will equalize, meaning if all caliber multipliers are set to 1 you will get an even mix of all calibers, and <em>then</em> the tier weights will kick in to determine <em>which</em> round in each caliber you see spawn more often. Huzzah for fancy math.</p>\n<p>Add the id’s or parent id’s of items to the config.json spawnpoint_item_blacklist to stop BOOBS from overwriting spawn points that contain any spawn point containing those items.</p>\n<p><strong>To install:</strong></p>\n<p>-Unzip the file into your base SPT directory - it should have the right filepath loaded already!</p>\n<p><strong>Might I also suggest:</strong><br />\n-My <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2509/ammo-clarity\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ammo Clarity</a> mod</p>\n<p><strong>HUGE thanks to those who tested this mod for me!</strong></p>\n<p>-FullerK_55</p>\n<p>-Nosliw</p>\n<p>-ComradeJagrad</p>\n<p><strong>If you’d like to support Jehree’s work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/jehree\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy him a coffee!</a></strong></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.2+spt-38", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1259, "published_at": "2024-06-05T13:25:17.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/981/balanced-overhaul-of-bullet-spawns-boobs/1.1.2+spt-38", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2193, "published_at": "2024-12-17T23:15:10.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/981/balanced-overhaul-of-bullet-spawns-boobs/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3630, "published_at": "2025-03-23T22:02:39.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/981/balanced-overhaul-of-bullet-spawns-boobs/2.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.8", "content_length": 22705, "downloads": 144, "published_at": "2025-12-19T15:01:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/981/balanced-overhaul-of-bullet-spawns-boobs/3.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.1.0", "spt_version_constrain